{
  "module": "kojo/111700-Win-Variation/ero-117.kojo",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "b3f6f9cad4cbdb6f1feb313955387ade",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/111700-Win-Variation/ero-117.kojo",
      "key": "rape_standing",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_standing",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "e519202b2196948646d4d86e11bd7a18070417f2ad8ce12ec637eee7a1f76f86",
      "sourceFileHash": "8600c76daf5e2bdd397b15e17cd82f1d2fb2955ecc34b124f9618f3986f8c0d9",
      "originalText": "柔軟性とバランスに優れた踊り手が、目の前で身体を見せている。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "b22f27d91ec1fcd5226948acebc02c12",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/111700-Win-Variation/ero-117.kojo",
      "key": "rape_standing",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_standing",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "cb7ef2cd9791504d5b8102f6cf696c49e4ec5d0bd11fb9fe996e95d30d68101e",
      "sourceFileHash": "8600c76daf5e2bdd397b15e17cd82f1d2fb2955ecc34b124f9618f3986f8c0d9",
      "originalText": "やはり、ウマ%UMA%は柔軟もバランスもいい。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "b332bdea766c8469af5537be358c4c38",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/111700-Win-Variation/ero-117.kojo",
      "key": "rape_standing",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_standing",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "ae3c294433a010271d5b6a2822cf1505c2d45492521314273972cdee273c53c9",
      "sourceFileHash": "8600c76daf5e2bdd397b15e17cd82f1d2fb2955ecc34b124f9618f3986f8c0d9",
      "originalText": "爪先だけを床につけ、太ももの内側を伸ばし、右脚をゆっくり水平まで上げていく。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "31ca0c0687b40fbd092f6c39d3af653a",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/111700-Win-Variation/ero-117.kojo",
      "key": "rape_standing",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_standing",
        3
      ],
      "originalHash": "530165b220e79d24f628e462b326ad10dfe5c0434e317a6b2d88c2131cca5855",
      "sourceFileHash": "8600c76daf5e2bdd397b15e17cd82f1d2fb2955ecc34b124f9618f3986f8c0d9",
      "originalText": "懸命にサイドレッグリフトの姿勢を取る %CALL_117% は、細い腰と誘うような横尻を、こうして晒している。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "6f35d1965eca99b1b87f40328c51ab20",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/111700-Win-Variation/ero-117.kojo",
      "key": "rape_standing",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_standing",
        4,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "0ac491360bb3d537af00bfbea4542ca3556998d4c1d949a5b98c43f14e795b8a",
      "sourceFileHash": "8600c76daf5e2bdd397b15e17cd82f1d2fb2955ecc34b124f9618f3986f8c0d9",
      "originalText": "陰毛に隠れた秘部が、張りつめた動きに合わせて開いては閉じる。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "8095f0cec3ebd58b308997b92dd28055",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/111700-Win-Variation/ero-117.kojo",
      "key": "rape_standing",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_standing",
        5,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "6f969f774f37dc77ecb15bb5b8e67d8b5158a23a6c9e359116d5b5c59863f684",
      "sourceFileHash": "8600c76daf5e2bdd397b15e17cd82f1d2fb2955ecc34b124f9618f3986f8c0d9",
      "originalText": "滑らかで愛らしい秘部が、張りつめた動きに合わせて開いては閉じる。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "0398c5fc0212d80408ff0acf3feca07c",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/111700-Win-Variation/ero-117.kojo",
      "key": "rape_standing",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_standing",
        6,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "50548d39d4ec1814714ea1157961b093a3716e62b81063e7611133fc331f759b",
      "sourceFileHash": "8600c76daf5e2bdd397b15e17cd82f1d2fb2955ecc34b124f9618f3986f8c0d9",
      "originalText": "「満足したでしょ……クズ！」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "c86aa84d1900a99d6611dd57fd24efb1",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/111700-Win-Variation/ero-117.kojo",
      "key": "rape_standing",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_standing",
        7
      ],
      "originalHash": "39820808e3761c53b72f76be598c629f3906c2fd374af91daf4b2fc64480abe3",
      "sourceFileHash": "8600c76daf5e2bdd397b15e17cd82f1d2fb2955ecc34b124f9618f3986f8c0d9",
      "originalText": "まだ限界ではなさそうだ。手を伸ばして姿勢を正し、水平に保たれた右脚を、さらにゆっくり持ち上げる。垂直に、左脚と一直線になるまで。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "fa39b5f719eea9806c48231380c5514f",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/111700-Win-Variation/ero-117.kojo",
      "key": "rape_standing",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_standing",
        8,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "e329b0f2c8f7d37592e11194a81de841a112158934447057561eaad4136707d8",
      "sourceFileHash": "8600c76daf5e2bdd397b15e17cd82f1d2fb2955ecc34b124f9618f3986f8c0d9",
      "originalText": "「さ、触らないで……」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "fa12f29c870f87793a55ca85a7b72f6f",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/111700-Win-Variation/ero-117.kojo",
      "key": "rape_standing",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_standing",
        9
      ],
      "originalHash": "87a544a09d82005ce017f168f6a37ddc18b71b7e0f17c834579f850411e58a93",
      "sourceFileHash": "8600c76daf5e2bdd397b15e17cd82f1d2fb2955ecc34b124f9618f3986f8c0d9",
      "originalText": "肉茎がまっすぐに入り、狭く柔らかい腔を無理に押し広げる。熱い亀頭が、幾重にも蠕動して締めつける肉を無視し、花芯に突き当たった。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "ffe99f7087146cdeeca09cb63168a60f",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/111700-Win-Variation/ero-117.kojo",
      "key": "rape_standing",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
